{"id":"9f515ba69fab3ec2","group":"56","path":"56/56-ex-levy-family-duplication.md","title":"复制同一家族与连续创建的区别","display":"ex-levy-family-duplication — 复制同一家族与连续创建的区别","type":"example","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"example","label":"56-ex-levy-family-duplication","aliases":["56-ex-levy-family-duplication"],"display":"ex-levy-family-duplication — 复制同一家族与连续创建的区别","depends_on":["[[56-df-levy-family-development]]","[[56-df-levy-label-depth]]"],"source_section":"§8.4.3 Example 8.4.36; §8.4.6 Example 8.4.49","source_printed_pages":"352,358","source_ocr_blocks":[373,379],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr; explicit-coding-local","source_proof_status":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"label","html":"56-ex-levy-family-duplication"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-ex-levy-family-duplication</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-levy-family-duplication — 复制同一家族与连续创建的区别"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"866869e983c8003f\" href=\"?note=866869e983c8003f\" title=\"56-df-levy-family-development\">56-df-levy-family-development</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3cc19c9ea2cdfd7f\" href=\"?note=3cc19c9ea2cdfd7f\" title=\"56-df-levy-label-depth\">56-df-levy-label-depth</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.4.3 Example 8.4.36; §8.4.6 Example 8.4.49"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"352,358"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>373</span><span>379</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr; explicit-coding-local"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>取互异函数符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,f,g,b\">\\(a,f,g,b\\)</span>，元数依次为0,1,2,0；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。规则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda=(f(x),g(x,x))\">\\(\\lambda=(f(x),g(x,x))\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu=(a,b)\">\\(\\mu=(a,b)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=\\{\\lambda,\\mu\\}\">\\(R=\\{\\lambda,\\mu\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 为空位置，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_1=(1)\\in W\">\\(\\iota_1=(1)\\in W\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_2=(2)\\in W\">\\(\\iota_2=(2)\\in W\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf A,\\mathsf C,\\operatorname{LInit},\\operatorname{LStep},\\operatorname{Deg},\\operatorname{Family}\">\\(\\mathsf A,\\mathsf C,\\operatorname{LInit},\\operatorname{LStep},\\operatorname{Deg},\\operatorname{Family}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"866869e983c8003f\" href=\"?note=866869e983c8003f\" title=\"56-df-levy-family-development\">56-df-levy-family-development</a> 的直接上游；深度见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3cc19c9ea2cdfd7f\" href=\"?note=3cc19c9ea2cdfd7f\" title=\"56-df-levy-label-depth\">56-df-levy-label-depth</a>。另取独立的单常元TRS <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_0=\\{\\nu\\}\">\\(R_0=\\{\\nu\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu=(a,a)\">\\(\\nu=(a,a)\\)</span>，并在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_0\">\\(R_0\\)</span> 的Lévy标签域内递归定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_n\">\\(c_n\\)</span>；零元带标符号同时记其零元项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\coloneqq f(a),\\qquad\n\\hat s\\coloneqq\\operatorname{LInit}_R(s),\\qquad\n\\hat t\\coloneqq\\operatorname{LStep}_R(\\hat s,(\\epsilon,f(x),g(x,x))),\\qquad\n\\delta\\coloneqq\\{(\\epsilon,\\mathsf A(s,\\iota_1))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\coloneqq f(a),\\qquad\n\\hat s\\coloneqq\\operatorname{LInit}_R(s),\\qquad\n\\hat t\\coloneqq\\operatorname{LStep}_R(\\hat s,(\\epsilon,f(x),g(x,x))),\\qquad\n\\delta\\coloneqq\\{(\\epsilon,\\mathsf A(s,\\iota_1))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Family}_R(\\hat t,\\delta)\n=\\{(\\iota_1,a,b),(\\iota_2,a,b)\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{PatternDeg}_R(\\hat t,(\\iota_1,a,b))=\n\\operatorname{PatternDeg}_R(\\hat t,(\\iota_2,a,b))=\\delta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Family}_R(\\hat t,\\delta)\n=\\{(\\iota_1,a,b),(\\iota_2,a,b)\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{PatternDeg}_R(\\hat t,(\\iota_1,a,b))=\n\\operatorname{PatternDeg}_R(\\hat t,(\\iota_2,a,b))=\\delta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"c_0\\coloneqq\\mathsf A(a,\\epsilon),\\qquad\nc_{n+1}\\coloneqq\\mathsf C(\\nu,c_n,\\epsilon)\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\n\\operatorname d_{R_0}(c_n)=n\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[c_0\\coloneqq\\mathsf A(a,\\epsilon),\\qquad\nc_{n+1}\\coloneqq\\mathsf C(\\nu,c_n,\\epsilon)\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\n\\operatorname d_{R_0}(c_n)=n\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LStep}_{R_0}(c_n,(\\epsilon,a,a))=c_{n+1},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Deg}_{R_0}(c_n,(\\epsilon,a,a))=(\\nu,c_n),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{PatternDeg}_{R_0}(c_n,(\\epsilon,a,a))=\\{(\\epsilon,c_n)\\},\\qquad\n\\left|\\{\\{(\\epsilon,c_n)\\}\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\right|=\\aleph_0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LStep}_{R_0}(c_n,(\\epsilon,a,a))=c_{n+1},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Deg}_{R_0}(c_n,(\\epsilon,a,a))=(\\nu,c_n),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{PatternDeg}_{R_0}(c_n,(\\epsilon,a,a))=\\{(\\epsilon,c_n)\\},\\qquad\n\\left|\\{\\{(\\epsilon,c_n)\\}\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\right|=\\aleph_0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一部分先收缩根，变量像a的原子标签被复制到两个孩子，两个位置的a红项于是属于同一家族；家族度不把当前位置纳入身份。任意选择其中一个收缩后，另一个仍保有原度。第二部分的普通项每步都仍是a，但Lévy标签持续记录创建历史，度两两不同，所以该无限归约不是有限家族发展。</p>\n<p>第一部分是Example 8.4.36与8.4.49的复制机制的最小本地实例；第二部分直接展开8.4.49的a→a例子。二者显示FFD不等同于“普通源目标只有有限多个项”，也不禁止一个度有多个复制残余。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-levy-family-development","status":"resolved","id":"866869e983c8003f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-levy-family-development]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-levy-label-depth","status":"resolved","id":"3cc19c9ea2cdfd7f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-levy-label-depth]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-levy-family-development","status":"resolved","id":"866869e983c8003f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"取互异函数符号 $a,f,g,b$，元数依次为0,1,2,0；$x\\in V$、$n\\in\\mathbb N$。规则 $\\lambda=(f(x),g(x,x))$、$\\mu=(a,b)$，$R=\\{\\lambda,\\mu\\}$。$\\epsilon$ 为空位置，$\\iota_1=(1)\\in W$、$\\iota_2=(2)\\in W$。$\\mathsf A,\\mathsf C,\\operatorname{LInit},\\operatorname{LStep},\\operatorname{Deg},\\operatorname{Family}$ 见 [[56-df-levy-family-development]] 的直接上游；深度见 [[56-df-